@startuml MII_Onko_Prostata_Module
title MII Onkologie - Organmodul Prostatakarzinom (oBDS P1-P9)
left to right direction
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam objectFontSize 15
skinparam packageFontSize 18
skinparam noteFontSize 14

' Zentrale Diagnose (oBDS Kapitel 5)
object Diagnose_Primaertumor [[StructureDefinition-mii-pr-onko-diagnose-primaertumor.html]] #FFFF66
Diagnose_Primaertumor : Condition, oBDS Kapitel 5

' Basisprofil Operation (oBDS Kapitel 13)
object Onko_Operation [[StructureDefinition-mii-pr-onko-operation.html]] #9999FF
Onko_Operation : Procedure, oBDS Kapitel 13
Onko_Operation : Basisprofil der Organmodule

object Prostata_Operation [[StructureDefinition-mii-pr-onko-prostata-operation.html]] #9999FF
Prostata_Operation : kein oBDS-Modulfeld (Kapitel 13 / OPS)
Prostata_Operation : code.coding[sct] 1..1 required
Prostata_Operation : VS aus SCT 118877007 Procedure on prostate

package "Gleason (P1, P2)" as gleason #E8F5E8 {
    object Gleason_Score_Gesamt [[StructureDefinition-mii-pr-onko-prostate-gleason-score-gesamt.html]] #22FF22
    Gleason_Score_Gesamt : oBDS P1
    Gleason_Score_Gesamt : code = SCT 372278000
    Gleason_Score_Gesamt : valueCodeableConcept, Score 2-10

    object Gleason_Pattern [[StructureDefinition-mii-pr-onko-prostate-gleason-patterns.html]] #22FF22
    Gleason_Pattern : oBDS P1 (Komponente, keine eigene Feldnummer)
    Gleason_Pattern : code aus VS primaer / sekundaer / tertiaer
    Gleason_Pattern : valueCodeableConcept, Pattern 1-5

    object Gleason_Grade_Group [[StructureDefinition-mii-pr-onko-prostate-gleason-grade-group.html]] #22FF22
    Gleason_Grade_Group : oBDS P1 (ISUP-Ableitung)
    Gleason_Grade_Group : code = SCT 1812491000004107
    Gleason_Grade_Group : valueCodeableConcept, Grade Group 1-5
}

package "Stanzbiopsie (P3-P6)" as biopsie #E8F5E8 {
    object Anzahl_Stanzen [[StructureDefinition-mii-pr-onko-prostate-anzahl-stanzen.html]] #22FF22
    Anzahl_Stanzen : oBDS P4
    Anzahl_Stanzen : code = LOINC 44652-6
    Anzahl_Stanzen : valueInteger
    Anzahl_Stanzen : effectiveDateTime = oBDS P3

    object Anzahl_Positive_Stanzen [[StructureDefinition-mii-pr-onko-prostate-anzahl-positive-stanzen.html]] #22FF22
    Anzahl_Positive_Stanzen : oBDS P5
    Anzahl_Positive_Stanzen : code = LOINC 44651-8
    Anzahl_Positive_Stanzen : valueInteger 1..1

    object CA_Befall_Stanze [[StructureDefinition-mii-pr-onko-prostate-ca-befall-stanze.html]] #22FF22
    CA_Befall_Stanze : oBDS P6
    CA_Befall_Stanze : code = LOINC 44654-2
    CA_Befall_Stanze : valueQuantity in %
}

object PSA [[StructureDefinition-mii-pr-onko-prostate-psa.html]] #22FF22
PSA : oBDS P7 (Wert), P8 (Datum)
PSA : code aus VS PSA LOINC
PSA : valueQuantity in ng/mL
PSA : effectiveDateTime = oBDS P8

object Clavien_Dindo [[StructureDefinition-mii-pr-onko-prostate-clavien-dindo.html]] #22FF22
Clavien_Dindo : oBDS P9
Clavien_Dindo : code = SCT 789279006
Clavien_Dindo : method = SCT 789278003
Clavien_Dindo : value coding[ClavienDindo | OBDSPostOPKompl]

object Onko_Specimen [[StructureDefinition-mii-pr-onko-specimen.html]] #44FFFF
Onko_Specimen : Specimen, oBDS Kapitel 6
Onko_Specimen : Stanzen, Prostatektomie-Praeparat, TURP-Resektat

' Referenzen gemaess FSH-Profilen
Diagnose_Primaertumor <-- Gleason_Score_Gesamt : focus
Diagnose_Primaertumor <-- Gleason_Pattern : focus
Diagnose_Primaertumor <-- Gleason_Grade_Group : focus
Diagnose_Primaertumor <-- Anzahl_Stanzen : focus
Diagnose_Primaertumor <-- Anzahl_Positive_Stanzen : focus
Diagnose_Primaertumor <-- CA_Befall_Stanze : focus
Diagnose_Primaertumor <-- PSA : focus
Diagnose_Primaertumor <-- Clavien_Dindo : focus[Diagnose] 1..1

Prostata_Operation .down.|> Onko_Operation : Parent
Diagnose_Primaertumor <-- Prostata_Operation : reasonReference
Clavien_Dindo -down-> Onko_Operation : focus[Operation] 1..1

Gleason_Score_Gesamt .down.> Onko_Specimen : specimen 0..1
Gleason_Pattern .down.> Onko_Specimen : specimen 0..1
CA_Befall_Stanze .down.> Onko_Specimen : specimen 0..1
PSA .down.> Onko_Specimen : specimen 0..1
Clavien_Dindo .down.> Onko_Specimen : specimen 0..1

note bottom of gleason
**P1 Gleason-Score**
Drei alternative Profile:
- Gleason_Score_Gesamt: nur Summe 2-10
- Gleason_Pattern: primaer / sekundaer /
  tertiaer, das Pattern ergibt sich
  aus Observation.code
- Gleason_Grade_Group: ISUP 1-5

**P2 Anlass Gleason-Score** (Stanze / OP)
hat in v2027 kein dediziertes Profil;
Abbildung als Komponente bzw. Methode
der Gleason-Observation.
end note

note bottom of biopsie
**P3 Datum der Stanzen**
kein eigenes Profil: abgebildet als
Observation.effectiveDateTime bzw.
Specimen.collection.collectedDateTime.
end note

note right of Clavien_Dindo
**P9 Postoperative Komplikation**
focus ist gesliced und verweist
zwingend sowohl auf die Diagnose
als auch auf die Operation.
end note

legend right
|Color|Type|
|<#FFFF66>|Condition|
|<#CCCCFF>|CarePlan / RequestGroup|
|<#9999FF>|Procedure|
|<#DDFFDD>|ServiceRequest|
|<#88FF88>|DiagnosticReport|
|<#22FF22>|Observation|
|<#FFCCFF>|MedicationStatement / MedicationRequest|
|<#FF9999>|AdverseEvent|
|<#44FFFF>|Specimen|
|<#EEEEEE>|List / ResearchStudy|
endlegend

@enduml
